DESCRIPTION:World Grand Prix\nDay 1 of 7 - opening day\nMonday 28 Septemb
 er 2026\n\nSession times\nNOT YET PUBLISHED. The PDC releases its schedu
 le of play (afternoon/evening session start times and the order of match
 es) a few weeks before each major\, so this is an all-day entry for now.
 \n\nVenue: Mattioli Arena\nAddress: 12 Memory Ln\, Leicester LE1 3UL\, U
 K\nTournament dates: Mon 28 Sep - Sun 4 Oct 2026\nField: 32 players - to
 p 16 Order of Merit plus 16 ProTour qualifiers\nPrize fund: GBP 750\,000
  (winner GBP 150\,000)\n\nTV\nSky Sports (UK) / DAZN\, PDCTV and other i
 nternational partners\n\nNotes\n29th staging. The only event on the PDC 
 circuit played DOUBLE IN\, DOUBLE OUT - players must start a leg on a do
 uble or the bullseye as well as finish on one\, which makes for very dif
 ferent scoring patterns. Set format throughout\, getting longer as the t
 ournament progresses. Luke Littler is defending champion after beating L
 uke Humphries 6-1 in the 2025 final. Prize fund is up from GBP 600\,000.
CATEGORIES:Darts,PDC Major
